        "slc_7bf55672c98afbb269de7bc18b6d0b61d7f3d9d86888a54a023ed30ddf2792a5"
      ],
      "text": "HAPI lets users run sessions of agents such as Claude Code, Codex, Cursor Agent, Grok Build, OpenCode, Kimi, Copilot, Antigravity, Pi, and DeepSeek Harness, controlled remotely via iOS/Android apps, Web/PWA, or a Telegram Mini App."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_414f7631e6713b6e127c4c177ce42ce772f96d6e0f9c68ed052f659428faf56f",
