          "repository": "tiann/hapi",
          "url": "https://github.com/tiann/hapi/blob/de6c9dee2032059b11fa3a4e23f5a805b28667b4/README.md#L31-L33"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d868e97ceb84c5f7366251c508c53d013c1244aca2a78f08b5322823c2ea79b5"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI supports starting an agent directly with `hapi <agent> [options]` (e.g. `hapi claude`), and scripts must specify the agent explicitly; `hapi --help` lists commands and supported agents."
    },
